WEBVTT

00:21:59.529 --> 00:22:02.689
of the introverted half
of their workforces.

00:22:02.713 --> 00:22:05.629
So it's really a bottom-line
question as well.

00:22:05.653 --> 00:22:07.773
CA: What's distinctive
about those talents?

00:22:07.797 --> 00:22:10.216
SC: Well, I mean, there are
so many different ones.

00:22:10.240 --> 00:22:13.537
First of all, I'll start with
a counterintuitive one,

00:22:13.561 --> 00:22:17.529
which is, people assume
that introverted leadership

00:22:17.553 --> 00:22:19.589
would be less effective,

00:22:19.613 --> 00:22:23.613
but the studies that we have
and lots of the anecdotal data

00:22:23.637 --> 00:22:25.312
that we see out there

00:22:25.336 --> 00:22:30.360
suggests that introverted leaders
actually deliver pretty great results.